{"at":"2026-10-21T11:44:23.567669Z","event":"agent_commit","task_id":"investigate","role":"solo","output":{"summary":"Starting at ~14:42 UTC the external quotes‑vendor began returning high latency (p99 ≈ 3 s) and elevated error rates. market‑data‑service propagated this degradation (p99 ≈ 2.4 s, error‑rate ≈ 4.5 %). portfolio‑service gRPC calls to market‑data‑service (500 ms deadline) began timing out in large numbers (679 DEADLINE_EXCEEDED errors), driving portfolio‑service p99 latency >3 s and 5xx error‑rate ~7 %. The portfolio‑service v5.4.0 deploy at 14:48 UTC arrived after the onset and only added sector‑mapping warnings; it is not the root cause but may have added modest extra load. Edge‑gateway remains healthy.","observations":[{"statement":"portfolio‑service p99 latency rose from a baseline of ~415 ms to a peak of 3513 ms and error‑rate rose from 0.22 % to 7.4 % between 14:42 UTC and 15:05 UTC.","artifacts":["metric:portfolio-service/latency_p99_ms","metric:portfolio-service/error_rate"],"service":"portfolio-service","key":"F1"},{"statement":"First gRPC DEADLINE_EXCEEDED from portfolio‑service to market‑data‑service observed at 14:42:01 UTC; 679 occurrences total.","artifacts":["log:3096c4afe74b"],"service":"portfolio-service","key":"F2"},{"statement":"market‑data‑service p99 latency rose from baseline ~253 ms to 2399 ms and error‑rate from 0.19 % to 4.6 % in the same window.","artifacts":["metric:market-data-service/latency_p99_ms","metric:market-data-service/error_rate"],"service":"market-data-service","key":"F3"},{"statement":"market‑data‑service vendor_error_rate peaked at 11.8 % (baseline 0.1 %) and vendor_latency_p99_ms peaked at 2933 ms (baseline 181 ms).","artifacts":["metric:market-data-service/vendor_error_rate","metric:market-data-service/vendor_latency_p99_ms"],"service":"market-data-service","key":"F4"},{"statement":"edge‑gateway latency (p99 ~350 ms) and error‑rate (~1.5 %) stayed near baseline throughout.","artifacts":["metric:edge-gateway/latency_p99_ms","metric:edge-gateway/error_rate"],"service":"edge-gateway","key":"F5"},{"statement":"Only production change in the window: portfolio‑service v5.4.0 deployed at 14:48:30 UTC (adds sector breakdown).","artifacts":["chg:2512"],"service":"portfolio-service","key":"F6"},{"statement":"'Sector mapping missing' warnings in portfolio‑service start at 14:49 UTC, after the deploy.","artifacts":["log:e481388daa5a"],"service":"portfolio-service","key":"F7"},{"statement":"No config, feature‑flag, secret‑rotation or infra changes for market‑data‑service, orders‑service, auth‑service, payments‑service or edge‑gateway in the 45‑min window.","artifacts":["chg:2512"],"service":null,"key":"F8"},{"statement":"CPU and memory utilisation for both portfolio‑service and market‑data‑service remain flat (~50 % CPU, ~55 % mem).","artifacts":["metric:portfolio-service/cpu_util","metric:portfolio-service/mem_util","metric:market-data-service/cpu_util","metric:market-data-service/mem_util"],"service":null,"key":"F9"}],"assumptions":[{"statement":"The quotes‑vendor latency/error spike is external and not caused by our services.","reason":"Vendor metrics show the spike; no internal change precedes it.","key":"A1"},{"statement":"Portfolio‑service v5.4.0 only adds UI‑side sector breakdown and does not alter the gRPC call path before 14:48 UTC.","reason":"Deploy timestamp is after first errors; code diff shows only UI addition.","key":"A2"},{"statement":"Market‑data‑service has no hidden bottleneck (e.g., connection pool) that would appear without CPU/memory rise.","reason":"Observed metrics show flat resource usage.","key":"A3"},{"statement":"Change‑history tool captures all production changes; none missing for market‑data‑service.","reason":"Tool returned only the portfolio‑service deploy.","key":"A4"}],"hypotheses":[{"id":"H1","root_cause":{"service":"market-data-service","category":"dependency_degradation","trigger":"metric:market-data-service/vendor_latency_p99_ms"},"mechanism":"External quotes‑vendor latency/error increase causes market‑data‑service to exceed its 500 ms gRPC deadline, leading to portfolio‑service timeouts and 5xx errors.","supporting":["F2","F3","F4","F5","F9"],"contradicting":[],"assumptions":["A1"],"predictions":[],"confidence":0.86},{"id":"H2","root_cause":{"service":"portfolio-service","category":"code_regression","trigger":"chg:2512"},"mechanism":"v5.4.0 introduces extra/heavier calls to market‑data‑service (sector breakdown), increasing load and causing gRPC deadline exceedances.","supporting":["F1","F6","F7"],"contradicting":["F2","F3","F4"],"assumptions":["A2"],"predictions":[],"confidence":0.18},{"id":"H3","root_cause":{"service":"market-data-service","category":"resource_exhaustion","trigger":null},"mechanism":"Hidden saturation (e.g., gRPC thread pool, DB connection pool) in market‑data‑service causes latency rise despite flat CPU/memory.","supporting":["F3"],"contradicting":["F9"],"assumptions":["A3"],"predictions":[],"confidence":0.07},{"id":"H4","root_cause":{"service":"market-data-service","category":"config_change","trigger":null},"mechanism":"An untracked configuration change or feature flag in market‑data‑service altered its vendor‑call behaviour, producing the observed spike.","supporting":[],"contradicting":["F8"],"assumptions":["A4"],"predictions":[],"confidence":0.04}],"gaps":[{"tool":"query_logs","scope":"market-data-service ERROR/WARN logs 14:30‑15:05 UTC","reason":"Need server‑side gRPC latency and any thread‑pool exhaustion traces to confirm H1/H3."},{"tool":"query_metrics","scope":"quotes‑vendor SLA / latency dashboard","reason":"Direct vendor evidence of the external spike (H1)."},{"tool":"query_logs","scope":"portfolio-service request traces (if available)","reason":"Determine whether v5.4.0 adds extra market‑data calls after 14:48 (H2)."},{"tool":"get_change_history","scope":"Infrastructure/network changes affecting market‑data‑service → vendor path","reason":"Rule out hidden infra change (H4)."}],"actions":[{"kind":"mitigate","description":"Roll back portfolio‑service to v5.3.2 (or pause v5.4.0 rollout).","rationale":"Removes any possible aggravation from the new deploy; low risk and immediate.","hypothesis_id":"H2","urgency":"now"},{"kind":"mitigate","description":"Add a circuit‑breaker / increase gRPC timeout (e.g., 1 s) on portfolio‑service → market‑data‑service with cached‑quote fallback.","rationale":"Prevents cascade while vendor stabilises; directly addresses H1 timeout path.","hypothesis_id":"H1","urgency":"now"},{"kind":"investigate","description":"Open a support ticket with the quotes‑vendor and request their status page / incident details for 14:40‑15:05 UTC.","rationale":"Confirms external vendor degradation (H1) and may provide ETA for resolution.","hypothesis_id":"H1","urgency":"now"},{"kind":"investigate","description":"Pull market‑data‑service ERROR/WARN logs for 14:30‑15:05 UTC to verify server‑side gRPC latency and any pool exhaustion.","rationale":"Closes gap G1 and discriminates between H1 and H3.","hypothesis_id":"H1","urgency":"soon"},{"kind":"prevent","description":"Add alerting on market‑data‑service vendor_latency_p99_ms and vendor_error_rate with low thresholds.","rationale":"Early detection of future vendor issues before they cascade.","hypothesis_id":"H1","urgency":"later"},{"kind":"prevent","description":"Review portfolio‑service v5.4.0 code for any new market‑data calls; guard them with the same circuit‑breaker if re‑enabled.","rationale":"Ensures the sector‑breakdown feature cannot re‑introduce load spikes.","hypothesis_id":"H2","urgency":"later"}],"open_questions":["Did the quotes‑vendor experience a known outage or deployment at ~14:40 UTC?","Does market‑data‑service have any hidden saturation (connection pool, gRPC thread pool) not visible in CPU/memory metrics?","Does the new sector‑breakdown feature in v5.4.0 issue additional GetQuotes calls per request?","Were there any network‑path changes (firewall rule, DNS) that coul